<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CREATECG "文字カウント画像" "グラフィック\システム\文字カウント画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
<TXSPN>I could not bear it any longer, and threw myself onto the bed.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
The accident 12 years ago.
{PAUSE ""}
A person called <STYLE ID="1" RUBY="えいいちろう">Eiichiro</STYLE> Niimura.
{PAUSE ""}
The Megasawa City murders.
{PAUSE ""}
April 8.
{PAUSE ""}
The thirteenth-year memorial.
{PAUSE ""}
<STYLE ID="2">Kogori-senpai</STYLE>'s dream.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
There are far too many uncertain factors to treat it as a hypothesis.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
If I had the time, I would like to think it over more carefully, but...<PG>
Now then, do I phone <STYLE ID="3">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, or not?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
This is a very important choice.
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
